j2html (https://github.com/tipsy/j2html), Apache License 2.0

j2act's tag API follows j2html: static TagCreator factories that take children
only, typed per-element tag classes, with*/withCond*/is* attribute builders, and
the each/iff/join helpers. The idea of generating that API from an HTML model and
checking the model against the HTML specification comes from j2html's
j2html-codegen module. j2act's generator is a new implementation of that design.

